<title>SPAIN: Spain's Rato sees 1998 exports up 10 percent.</title>
<headline>Spain's Rato sees 1998 exports up 10 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Economy Minister Rodrigo Rato said  on Friday he expects Spanish exports to rise 10 percent in 1998 and  imports to grow by 2.5 percent above 1997 levels.</p>
<p>&quot;Exports will grow more or less at the same rate as in 1997, that  is around 10 percent,&quot; Rato told a news conference after the weekly  cabinet meeting.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom + 34 1 585-2160</p>
